{%- doc -%}
  Outputs the string "true" when the given product qualifies for the current
  gift promotion, otherwise outputs nothing. Capture it and compare:

    {%- capture is_offer -%}{%- render 'is-gift-offer', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- if is_offer contains 'true' -%} ... {%- endif -%}

  Config comes exclusively from the Elixir Promotions app's shop metafields:
    elixir_promotions.gift_offer_active     — master switch
    elixir_promotions.gift_offer_mode       — quantity | amount | bogo (gift families),
                                   discount (% / amount off, applied at the cart)
                                   or markdown (product price already reduced)
    elixir_promotions.gift_offer_scope_all  — store-wide offers (spend model without a collection)
    elixir_promotions.gift_offer_collection — the qualifying collection

  Only the GIFT families ever qualify a product here. A `discount`/`markdown`
  offer drives the promo banner but must never badge a product as a free gift.

  @param {object} product - the product to test
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- capture offer_on -%}{%- render 'gift-offer-active' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- liquid
  assign offer_mode = shop.metafields.elixir_promotions.gift_offer_mode.value
  assign is_gift_mode = true
  if offer_mode == 'discount' or offer_mode == 'markdown'
    assign is_gift_mode = false
  endif
  assign match = false

  if offer_on contains 'true' and product != blank and is_gift_mode
    if shop.metafields.elixir_promotions.gift_offer_scope_all.value == true
      assign match = true
    endif

    unless match
      assign eff_collection = shop.metafields.elixir_promotions.gift_offer_collection.value
      if eff_collection != blank
        for c in product.collections
          if c.id == eff_collection.id
            assign match = true
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endif
    endunless
  endif

  if match
    echo 'true'
  endif
-%}
